@startuml
<style>
timingDiagram {
  constraintArrow { LineColor red ; LineThickness 3 ; FontColor blue ; FontSize 16 }
}
</style>
robust "R" as R
concise "C" as C
binary "B" as B
analog "A" between 0 and 10 as A
rectangle "X" as X
clock Clk with period 10
@0
R is a
C is b
B is low
A is 2
X is p
@20
R is c
C is d
B is high
A is 8
X is q
note top of C : note
highlight 5 to 12 : hl
C@0 -> R@15 : msg
R@20 <-> @30 : {10}
@enduml
